    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60588" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυΐσκομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, of the female, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>conceive, become pregnant</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				543b19
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυϊσκομένη τε καὶ τίκτουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					149b
