				3.2.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυΐσκω</span> in same sense, <i><span class="en">
