				4.513
			</span></i>; but </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> causal,
			of the male, <i>impregnate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Him.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>.</div>
